commit 6de63d677011ee1e11c10cb0ae3a417c85a0666c

C03: a text to «put on it» with no target asks where to write it (UI1643)

«ponle hola» asks to write a text in «something» that nothing before names — no window, field, file, note or chat. The deictic_text input kind («ponle/ponele/ponmelo <texto>» with no recipient or place; requests with «a Juan», «en la nota» stay outside) now decides zero operations and a question asking where to write that text, validated to ask where and never to claim it was written.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


